{"id":"vod_bf_14561","vodId":"14561","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"回转企鹅罐","name_cn":"回转企鹅罐","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-15/4a1e033e76ccc5627a6b0c47fbcbba8a.jpg"},"summary":"故事以高仓家三兄妹为中心而展开，高仓冠叶（木村昴  配音）、高仓晶马（木村良平 配音）兄弟俩和患有绝症的妹妹高仓阳毬（ 荒川美穂 配音）。　　有妹控情结的高仓兄弟俩都非常珍视阳毬，然而医生却让他们做好随时失去妹妹的准备。这天兄妹三人一同去水族馆游玩，可是一转眼兄弟二人发现妹妹不见了，随后他们在围观人群中央发现倒地不醒的阳毬。抢救无效被宣布死亡的阳毬竟然在停尸房里醒过来了！惊讶无比的兄弟俩把妹妹接回家，不久后他们收到了一份奇怪的包裹，打开后竟然发现里面有三只谜样企鹅。这三只企鹅憨态可掬，除了他们，外人都看不见这些企鹅。这一切究竟是怎么回事，命运的齿轮又会如何转动？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 03:36:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huizhuanqieguan/第14